@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra server -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. Khong ton tai -> 404 + PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Khong khop route int -> 404 body rong
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao hop le -> 201 + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

< ./src/Catalog.Api/sp-hop-le.json

### 7. Gia am -> 400 + INVALID_PRODUCT
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

< ./src/Catalog.Api/Properties/sp-sai.json

### 8. Sai Content-Type (tuong duong curl -d khong co -H JSON) -> 415
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

< ./src/Catalog.Api/sp-hop-le.json
